@TimetableSolver_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Inspect loaded dataset (JSON embedded data)
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/dataset
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Load and validate dataset (Summary + Data conflicts)
POST {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/load-data
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Generate full school timetable with Google OR-Tools CP-SAT solver
POST {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/generate?timeoutSeconds=300
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get Executive Summary
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get all section timetables (41 Sections, 2,132 slots)
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/sections
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get timetable for a specific section (e.g. Class 10 Lily)
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/sections/10-lily
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Get all teacher timetables (44 Teachers)
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/teachers
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Get timetable for a specific teacher (e.g. T01 or by name)
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/teachers/T01
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Get data gaps and scheduling conflicts
GET {{TimetableSolver_HostAddress}}/api/timetable/conflicts
Accept: application/json

###

